<%- include('../partials/head', { pageTitle: pageTitle }) %>
<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<main class="fb-container fb-main">
  <div class="fb-title-row">
    <h1 class="fb-title">Parents</h1>
  </div>

  <%- include('../partials/parents-nav') %>

  <div class="fb-content">
    <h2 class="fb-title fb-title--small">What Parents are Saying</h2>

    <div class="fb-prose">
      <p>A guestbook for parents and guardians: comments from people whose children use FieldBrik.</p>
    </div>

    <table class="fb-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">From</th>
          <th scope="col">Comment</th>
          <th scope="col">Date</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td colspan="3" class="fb-table__last">No comments yet.</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="fb-notice">
      <p><strong>This page is empty on purpose.</strong></p>
      <p>A guestbook with invented quotes on it would be worse than an empty one: the whole point of the page is that real parents said these things. The table fills as comments are left.</p>
      <p>Leaving a comment needs an account and a moderation queue, so it opens with the social service after accounts. Every entry is reviewed before it appears, and comments cannot be posted anonymously.</p>
    </div>

    <%- include('../partials/parents-nav') %>
  </div>
</main>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
